# "Choose one that hasn't been chosen" (CR 700.2): Silent Hallcreeper alone on Bot1's side. On turn 3 its hit cannot offer "becomes a copy of
# another target creature you control" (no other creature to target), so Bot1 draws a card. On turn 5 the draw is spent and refused; Bot1 takes
# the counters, and the permanent has chosen modes 1 and 2 (the counters and the draw).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Silent Hallcreeper
Island x22

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x24

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Silent Hallcreeper.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Silent Hallcreeper > Bot2)
! Bot1.Modes(This creature becomes a copy)
Bot1.Modes(Draw a card)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Silent Hallcreeper.ChosenModes = 2
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 7
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Silent Hallcreeper > Bot2)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot1.Battlefield.Silent Hallcreeper.ChosenModes = 1, 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Silent Hallcreeper.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
Bot1.Hand.Count = 8
